"The mermen of the Vaelyssan Sea were wiped out as a ruling power by one slime, Syl."
"Mermen culling had kept deep monsters in check; without it, surplus essence breeds more."
"Syl's personas Sylvain and the siren Vanessa guard the waters around Tanglebay."
"A few mermen stragglers may still live, and they can sense Syl wherever she goes."
